{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>THE SUN IS RISING.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>THERE'S NOT A CLOUD IN THE SKY.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>TRULY - A WONDERFUL DAY TO BE A HORSE.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >OVERVIEW</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >T\u00d6LT is a first-person adventure game set on a fully explorable island.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The objective is simple. You are a horse who lives on an island with all your friends. You wish for nothing more than to simply run around and hang out. Just as all horses love to do.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812490/extras/2a2b699ac28a86cf2724ff03c313ddfe.poster.avif?t=1762983120\" width=706 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812490/extras/2a2b699ac28a86cf2724ff03c313ddfe.webm?t=1762983120\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812490/extras/2a2b699ac28a86cf2724ff03c313ddfe.mp4?t=1762983120\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The humans on this island seem worried about something. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if what they say is true, it is of no concern to horses. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You have <i>everything you need</i> right in front of you. Rich pastures. Beautiful rivers. Picturesque mountains. A mysterious forest. <span class=\"bb_strike\">A bustling town filled with humans.</span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're already living each day like it's your last, so there is nothing more for you to fear.<br>A happy ending lies ahead. All you must do is simply be yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-------------------------------------------------------------------------</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3812490?t=1762983120","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3812490?t=1762983120","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812490/0bfb6639d5acc1476d60b99273144b7c91bd87b7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762983120","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812490/0bfb6639d5acc1476d60b99273144b7c91bd87b7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762983120","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4144210,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>THE SUN IS RISING.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>THERE'S NOT A CLOUD IN THE SKY.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>TRULY - A WONDERFUL DAY TO BE A HORSE.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >OVERVIEW</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >T\u00d6LT is a first-person adventure game set on a fully explorable island.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The objective is simple. You are a horse who lives on an island with all your friends. You wish for nothing more than to simply run around and hang out. Just as all horses love to do.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812490/extras/2a2b699ac28a86cf2724ff03c313ddfe.poster.avif?t=1762983120\" width=706 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812490/extras/2a2b699ac28a86cf2724ff03c313ddfe.webm?t=1762983120\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812490/extras/2a2b699ac28a86cf2724ff03c313ddfe.mp4?t=1762983120\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The humans on this island seem worried about something. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if what they say is true, it is of no concern to horses. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You have <i>everything you need</i> right in front of you. Rich pastures. Beautiful rivers. Picturesque mountains. A mysterious forest. <span class=\"bb_strike\">A bustling town filled with humans.</span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're already living each day like it's your last, so there is nothing more for you to fear.<br>A happy ending lies ahead. All you must do is simply be yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-------------------------------------------------------------------------</p>","developers":["ENIGMA STUDIO"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812490/99a00b2a40eae07a98bcca2ec56d0a06abaa30c4/header.jpg?t=1762983120","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3812490/788834347/772820662f81d8e58d57685fe192023cb62e122c/1750689336/dash_av1.mpd?t=1750690521","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3812490/788834347/772820662f81d8e58d57685fe192023cb62e122c/1750689336/dash_h264.mpd?t=1750690521","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3812490/788834347/772820662f81d8e58d57685fe192023cb62e122c/1750689336/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1750690521","id":257155592,"name":"T\u00d6LT - Trailer #1","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257155592/c15fb43b45c582c15e05cef7dec54a72b505cb00/movie_600x337.jpg?t=17